        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8634-8658"><rb>大海</rb><rt>おほうみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8658-8689">に舟滿ちつづけて。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-8689-8704">見はるかし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8704-8728"><rb>大君</rb><rt>おほきみ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8728-8740"><rb>宣</rb><rt>の</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8740-8751">らす、</seg></p>
