      <div>
        <p><seg source="#source-8878-8892">ヤァハレ</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8892-8916"><rb>國土</rb><rt>くにつち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8916-8922">や、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8922-8955"><rb>大國土</rb><rt>おほくにつち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8955-8962">。</seg></p>
