        <p><seg source="#source-9365-9379">ヤァハレ</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9379-9403"><rb>谷蟆</rb><rt>たにぐく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9403-9432">のさわたるきはみ、</seg></p>
