        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9706-9721"><rb>嶮</rb><rt>けは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9721-9727">し國</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9727-9745"><rb>平</rb><rt>たひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9745-9762">らけくや。</seg></p>
